{"duration_api_ms":77228,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"485357f2-cacd-4286-8627-94c54876bc02","total_cost_usd":0.7771180000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":64420,"cache_read_input_tokens":618670,"output_tokens":6896,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1137},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":64420,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":67073,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3327},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":26,"outputTokens":6896,"cacheReadInputTokens":618670,"cacheCreationInputTokens":64420,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7771180000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1137,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_017NrPm8nhxGUArV3ccMb1BV","tool_input":{"command":"cat -n src/DcaShop.Web/Controllers/ErrorPageController.cs; sed -n 25,45p src/DcaShop.Product/Adapter/Incoming/Web/ProductPageController.cs; grep -n \"StatusCodePages\\|UseStatusCode\\|/error\" src/DcaShop.Web/Program.cs; sed -n 80,100p tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests/ShopFlowTest.cs; cat -n tests/DcaShop.E2eTests/Pages/BasePage.cs | head -60; ls tests/DcaShop.E2eTests/*.cs; grep -rn \"TitleAsync\\|error-page\\|NotFound\" tests/DcaShop.E2eTests --include=*.cs 2>/dev/null | head; grep -n \"NotFound\\|404\\|error\" ../dca-sample-specification/scenarios.md | head","description":"Inspect error routing, tests, page objects, scenarios"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":16,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The plan is written to `tasks/not-found-title/plan.md`. It found nothing that needs a human decision.\n\n**The cause:** `src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Error/404.cshtml:1` sets the title to \"Page Not Found\". The shared layout only shows \"domaincentric.commerce\" when a page sets no title (`_Layout.cshtml:9`). The address `/products/no-such-product` isn't a valid product id, so it gets a 404 and lands on that page (`Program.cs:86`).\n\n**Planned change:**\n- **Production code:** one line in `404.cshtml`. Either remove the title so the layout's default shows, as the Java shop does (decision CAT-03-01), or set it to \"domaincentric.commerce\" explicitly. The build stage picks. The \"404\", the heading \"Page Not Found\", the message and both links stay as they are.\n- **Tests:** the story's one scenario gets a browser test (Playwright), in a new `NotFoundTitleE2eTest.cs` with a new `NotFoundPage` page object.\n- **Existing tests:** none needs changing. `ShopFlowTest.UnknownPageRendersThe404Page` checks the 404 status and the error page's body, not its title.\n\n**Worth knowing:**\n- **Context mismatch:** the story says `portal`, but the not-found page lives in the web host, not in the Portal project. `ErrorPageController` \"belongs to no context\" per AGENTS.md. The plan keeps the change where the page is today.\n- **Specification not checked:** the specification's `scenarios.md` needs a scenario titled \"The not-found page is titled with the shop's name\". Without it, `SharedScenariosTest` fails whenever it runs against the specification. That file is outside this checkout, so I didn't read it; the plan lists this as an open assumption.\n- **Other stories' edits:** `BasePage.cs` has uncommitted changes from other stories, and the plan says to keep them out of this story's change.\n\nI didn't consult `dca-knowledge`, because the story raises no architecture question. I ran no other stage.","ttft_ms":3094,"type":"result","duration_ms":85483,"uuid":"8265c12e-7a3c-47b1-b876-49053550cc2f","ttft_stream_ms":1849,"time_to_request_ms":151,"first_content_frame_ms":1850,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
